| Brainstorm & refine a new idea (`grilling`) and save to the Idea Bank (`docs/ideas.md`) | `/l1-idea` | `l1dder/skills/l1-idea/SKILL.md` |
| Write a feature spec (`docs/specs/FEAT-NNN/`) from an idea and slice steps `FEAT-NNN.01..99` into `docs/backlog.md` | `/l1-feature` | `l1dder/skills/l1-feature/SKILL.md` |
| Schedule or reorder the Roadmap (`docs/roadmap.md`), assign `SPRINT-NN` and `TASK-NN.01..99`, or reject the current sprint and roll back its changes | `/l1-planning` | `l1dder/skills/l1-planning/SKILL.md` |
| Execute the next task `TASK-NN.MM` from the Roadmap or the final `TASK-NN.99` (`Doctor Checklist`) | `/l1-task` | `l1dder/skills/l1-task/SKILL.md` |
