## 2. Project Stack Skills (Section `"stack"` in `l1dder/skills.json`)

> During `/l1-onboard`, the agent adds stack-specific skills to `l1dder/skills.json` and installs them into all configured agents:

```bash
# Add stack skills to l1dder/skills.json, download into l1dder/skills/, and sync to all agents:
npx l1dder skills add anthropics/skills --skill frontend-design,webapp-testing
npx l1dder skills add vercel-labs/agent-skills --skill vercel-react-best-practices,vercel-composition-patterns

# Install all stack skills declared in l1dder/skills.json:
npx l1dder skills install

# List all skills and their status:
npx l1dder skills list
```

| Work Type | Skill | Upstream Repo (`skills.json`) | Path After `npx l1dder skills install` |
|-----------|-------|-------------------------------|----------------------------------------|
| Frontend & UI Design | `frontend-design` | `anthropics/skills` | `l1dder/skills/frontend-design/SKILL.md` |
| Webapp & E2E Testing | `webapp-testing` | `anthropics/skills` | `l1dder/skills/webapp-testing/SKILL.md` |
| React / Next.js Best Practices | `vercel-react-best-practices` | `vercel-labs/agent-skills` | `l1dder/skills/vercel-react-best-practices/SKILL.md` |
